@startuml
!theme plain
!pragma layout smetana
title 4. Shipment 배송 상태 (ExternalShippingStatus)
hide empty description

[*] --> READY : shipment.request 수신\n/ shipment.created 발행
READY --> READY_FOR_PICKUP : / shipment.changed
READY_FOR_PICKUP --> SHIPPING : / shipment.changed
SHIPPING --> DELIVERED : / shipment.completed
SHIPPING -[#red]-> FAILED : / shipment.failed
READY -[#orange]-> CANCELLED : / shipment.cancelled (신규)
READY_FOR_PICKUP -[#orange]-> CANCELLED

DELIVERED --> [*]
FAILED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]

note right of CANCELLED
  현재 코드는 CANCELLED 에서
  publishShipCompleted() 호출 → 수정 필요
end note
@enduml
